{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>TrackCut 是一款結合 AI 主體追蹤、智能模糊與畫質增強的影片編輯工具，適合內容創作者、社群經營者，以及希望快速製作電影感短片的用戶。原價 US $49.99 的終生版現正限時免費，內購限時免費期間即可以 $0 收下。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-11.webp\">\n<h2>主體追蹤與畫質增強</h2>\n<p>TrackCut 的 AI 模糊編輯可自動追蹤移動主體，亦能偵測人臉保護私隱，或分離人像後柔化背景；手動模式可自行繪畫範圍與反轉圖層。AI 增強能把影片提升至 2K 或 4K，並為黑白片段一鍵上色。剪輯支援逐格修剪、音樂同步、文字與塗鴉，以及亮度與對比微調，成品可輸出 4K 且不加水印。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-393-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-394-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-395-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-396-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-397-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-398-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>TrackCut: Ai Video Editor 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TrackCut: Ai Video Editor</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.640134+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":446,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:18:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T20:58:13.149354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:47.638661+00:00","content_hash":"7217a5d9cb0e3faea348743e5171a8a7957857444b12790e11cf439217041005","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}